  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven equation : **78 + 456 - 45 × 12 ÷ 4 = 519**\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging of numbers and mathematical signs:\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 12 and 4, - and × \n\n78 + 456 × 45 - **4 ÷ 12**__ = 519\n\n78 + __**456 **____**×**____** 45**__ - 0.33 = 519\n\n__**78 + 20520**__ - 0.33 = 519\n\n__**20598 - 0.33**__ = 519\n\n20597.67 ≠ 519 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 78 and 456, ÷ and × \n\n456 + 78 - **45 ÷ 12**__ × 4 = 519\n\n456 + 78 - __**3.75 ×**____** 4**__ = 519\n\n__**456 + 78**__ - 15 = 519\n\n__**534 - 15**__ = 519\n\n519 = 519 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 45 and 12, + and ÷ \n\n**78 ÷ 456**__ - 12 × 45 + 4 = 519\n\n0.71 - __**12**____** × 45**__ + 4 = 519\n\n__**0.71 + 4**__ - 540 = 519\n\n__**4.71 - 540**__ = 519\n\n-535.29 ≠ 519 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 456 and 45, ÷ and -\n\n78 + **45 ÷ 456**__ × 12 - 4 = 519\n\n78 + __**0.09 × 12**__ - 4 = 519\n\n__**78 + 1.08**__ - 4 = 519\n\n__**79.08 - 4**__ = 519\n\n75.08 ≠ 519 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
